WEBVTT

00:00:59.621 --> 00:01:02.912
This process attempts to ensure
the only difference between the groups

00:01:02.954 --> 00:01:05.371
is the one the researchers
are attempting to study.

00:01:05.413 --> 00:01:08.288
For example, when testing 
a new headache medication,

00:01:08.329 --> 00:01:12.996
a large pool of people with headaches
would be randomly divided into two groups,

00:01:13.038 --> 00:01:16.038
one receiving the medication
and another receiving a placebo.

00:01:16.079 --> 00:01:17.954
With proper randomization,

00:01:17.996 --> 00:01:20.913
the only significant overall difference
between the two groups

00:01:20.954 --> 00:01:23.704
will be whether or not 
they received the medication,

00:01:23.746 --> 00:01:27.121
rather than other differences
that could affect results.

00:01:27.371 --> 00:01:30.121
Randomized clinical trials 
are incredible tools,